value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-11T01:05:10-08:00","id":845515,"title":"","content":"The later editions are a lot better about making it clear that multiple objects that are part of a whole concept (such as an outfit) should be treated as one object for Talisman Dedication. The ST has final say, but given that your objects are capped by your Gnosis, having socks, shoes, pants, underwear, and a shirt eat up 7 out of a potential 10 slots alone is exceedingly taxing, and is just going to end up with everyone trying to start with Magpie's Swag.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}